# shackled_escape (kenshi-h2v.15.3; docs/reference/SCENARIO_IMPORT.md `shackled=`). Three squadmates in locked shackles beside the Heft slave shop's cage, nobody ordered: the
# user picks, cuts and breaks from the inventory menu (order 60 actions 15 / 16 / 17, kenshi-h2v.15.1). Picker and Spare: lockpicking 40, strength 20, a hacksaw.
# Strong: strength 95, no tool. Each shackled char leads its own squad so none follows the Wanderer away from the others. A fourth squadmate is in the cage.
KSCEN 2
scenario title=Shackled%3A%20pick%2C%20cut%20or%20break setup=At%20the%20Heft%20slave%20shop%20the%20Wanderer%20stands%20by%20three%20squadmates%20in%20locked%20shackles%3A%20Picker%20%28lockpicking%2040%2C%20a%20hacksaw%2C%20weak%29%2C%20Spare%20%28the%20same%2C%20a%20second%20try%29%20and%20Strong%20%28strength%2095%2C%20no%20tool%29%2C%20and%20a%20fourth%20squadmate%20sits%20locked%20in%20the%20shop%27s%20cage.%20Nobody%20is%20ordered%3A%20open%20an%20inventory%20and%20use%20the%20shackles%27%20menu. look_for=Open%20the%20inventory%20of%20Picker%20%28or%20Spare%29%20and%20use%20the%20worn%20shackles%27%20menu.%20%281%29%20Pick%20Lock%20shows%20a%20chance%20%28level%2020%20against%20lockpicking%2040%29%3B%20picking%20takes%20a%20few%20tries%2C%20and%20when%20it%20works%20the%20shackles%20STAY%20WORN%20but%20are%20open%20%28the%20lock%20reads%20open%3B%20Take%20Off%20Shackles%2C%20task%20219%2C%20is%20what%20removes%20them%29.%20%282%29%20Use%20Tools%20%28Picker%20and%20Spare%20carry%20a%20hacksaw%29%3A%20a%20bar%20drains%20slowly%2C%20about%203%20min%20at%20strength%2020%20%28TASK_PROGRESS%20kind%207%2C%20hardness%20left%20falling%20from%2030%20to%200%3B%20a%20stronger%20cutter%20is%20faster%29%20and%20the%20shackles%20are%20gone%20at%20the%20end%3B%20Strong%20has%20no%20tool%2C%20so%20for%20Strong%20Use%20Tools%20is%20refused.%20%283%29%20Use%20Strength%3A%20refused%20for%20Picker%20and%20Spare%20%28strength%20must%20be%20above%203%20x%20the%20hardness%20left%2C%2090%20at%20the%20start%29%2C%20and%20instant%20for%20Strong%2C%20with%20the%20text%20Shackles%20broken%21%20and%20the%20shackles%20left%20worn%20and%20open.%20That%20is%20why%20bashing%20never%20works%20in%20Kenshi%20unless%20the%20character%20is%20very%20strong.%20Does%20the%20shown%20pick%20chance%20match%20how%20often%20it%20works%3F%20Is%20the%20refusal%20for%20the%20weak%20ones%20clear%3F%20A%20teammate%20can%20also%20work%20on%20another%27s%20shackles%3A%20order%20Picker%20to%20cut%20Strong%27s%2C%20he%20walks%20over%20and%20does%20it%20%28freeing%20a%20captive%27s%20shackles%20is%20a%20crime%20against%20the%20captor%29.%20The%20caged%20squadmate%27s%20cage%20can%20be%20picked%20or%20cut%20the%20same%20way%20from%20its%20own%20inventory%20or%20by%20a%20squadmate. bead=kenshi-h2v.15 metrics=player_downed_s
